  abilityDescription: "Flying and unblockable. Sprays rapid, weak plasma rounds at the nearest operator within 2.5 tiles, crawling while it fires. Fires for 5 s, then reloads for 2 s at half speed. High DEF shrugs off most of each round."
  intelQuote: "*BZZZT*"
  intelLore: "A salvaged industrial drone retrofitted with a jury-rigged weapon mount. Robodrone doesn't land, doesn't stop, and doesn't care who it hits. Field teams report it prefers to take potshots at operators in elevated positions."

